 8. 🍿 1 film thing: Hollywood&#x27;s sizzling summer 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Scene from "Spider-Man: Brand New Day." Photo: Sony Pictures via AP This year's hot summer box office — anchored by "Spider-Man: Brand New Day," "The Odyssey" and "Toy Story 5" — broke the record for ticket revenue from May 1 through Labor Day with $4.76 billion in sales.

 Revenue narrowly passed the $4.755 billion in sales from 2013. Go deeper . 

 
 
